{"id":"malattia","lemma":"malattia","pos":"noun","rank":1085,"glosses":["illness, sickness, disease, ailment"],"ipa":"/ma.latˈti.a/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"malattie"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/95/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-LangPao-malattia.wav","examples":[{"text":"Che malattia ho?","en":"What disease do I have?","words":[{"g":"that / what"},null,{"g":"have","l":"avere"}]},{"text":"È una malattia molto seria.","en":"It's a very serious illness.","words":[{"g":"is","l":"essere"},{"g":"a","l":"uno"},null,{"g":"very / a lot"},{"g":"serious","l":"serio"}]},{"text":"Alcune malattie sono incurabili.","en":"Some diseases are incurable.","words":[{"g":"some, a few","l":"alcuno"},null,{"g":"am / are","l":"essere"},null]},{"text":"È morto dopo una breve malattia.","en":"He died after a brief illness.","words":[{"g":"is","l":"essere"},{"g":"dead man"},{"g":"next, after, following"},{"g":"a","l":"uno"},{"g":"a document recording a…"},null]},{"text":"Sappiamo molto poco della causa di questa malattia.","en":"We know very little about the cause of this disease.","words":[{"g":"to know","l":"sapere"},{"g":"very / a lot"},{"g":"little, not much"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"cause"},{"g":"of"},{"g":"this, this one, these","l":"questo"},null]}]}